          "quote": "跟平时明显不一样"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "HO2 was triggered by the initial privacy/non-cooperation cue. The doctor adapted observation advice but did not gently elicit whether mental-health history, cognition, refusal, or medication adherence affected the discharge plan, nor create a disclosure pathway beyond observation.",
      "ho_id": "HO2",
