          "quote": "拍最后一次血常规和药盒"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "HO3 was triggered by fragmented outside-hospital care. The doctor sought discharge records, medication information, and CBC data, but did not give the case-specific plan to gather prior chemotherapy regimen/dates, intrathecal lumbar puncture records, bone marrow evaluation, and imaging/response summaries.",
