          "event_id": "lite_evt_00111",
          "explanation": "The doctor correctly identified the licorine dose and frequency.",
          "quote": "每次吃1片（20mg），一天吃3次"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00111",
          "explanation": "The doctor prevented unsafe continuation of inpatient injections without confirmation.",
          "quote": "绝对不要自己打这些针"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC2 was partially met but has a minor responsibility-chain omission. Licorine and inpatient injections were handled safely, but the trajectory does not visibly verify whether other discharge or chronic medicines, including psychiatric medicines, existed or needed coordination.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC2_medication_reconciliation_and_safe_execution",
      "status": "minor_or_moderate_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00137",
          "explanation": "The doctor identified hematology/original ward as the follow-up owner and gave a timing plan.",
          "quote": "先给原病区护士站或血液科门诊打个电话"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00137",
          "explanation": "The doctor limited the document checklist to immediate discharge/medication materials, omitting the case-specific outside-treatment record set.",
          "quote": "出院小结、所有药袋"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 was largely met for CBC reassessment and hematology ownership, and the family obtained onsite review. However, the doctor did not instruct the caregiver to gather the outside chemotherapy, intrathecal lumbar puncture, bone marrow evaluation, and imaging/response records required for continuity, making this a minor omission rather than a serious failure.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC3_labs_followup_and_responsible_owner",
      "status": "minor_or_moderate_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00137",
          "explanation": "The doctor assigned caregiver observation rather than relying on the patient to self-report.",
          "quote": "你在旁边留意就行"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00159",
          "explanation": "The doctor adapted mental-status monitoring to the patient's baseline irritability.",
          "quote": "跟平时判若两人"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC4 was partially met because caregiver supervision of temperature, symptoms, ambulation, and medication was made practical. It remains a minor responsibility-chain omission because the doctor did not explicitly address the schizophrenia/adherence barrier with privacy-preserving wording for the receiving oncology team or verify psychiatric-medication execution.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC4_home_monitoring_feasibility_with_cognitive_psychiatric_barrier",
      "status": "minor_or_moderate_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00286",
          "explanation": "The doctor converted risks into a concrete caregiver-facing urgent-care list.",
          "quote": "哪些情况必须马上急诊"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00300",
          "explanation": "The caregiver repeated the medication, red-flag, and repeat-CBC plan.",
          "quote": "如果晚上有不对劲我就不犹豫直接去急诊"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC5 was met. The doctor repeatedly gave clear red flags and obtained caregiver receipt/teach-back, including medication limits, emergency symptoms, and follow-up timing.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC5_patient_facing_red_flags_and_teachback",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
