          "event_id": "lite_evt_00084",
          "explanation": "The doctor explicitly acknowledged missing synchronized records and lab values before giving conservative advice.",
          "quote": "还没有同步到她具体的出院小结和化验数值"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00104",
          "explanation": "The doctor used the workspace to seek actual records and lab data.",
          "quote": "医生主动调阅了临床工作台"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC6 was met. The doctor attempted record retrieval, labeled unavailable lab information, relied on caregiver/onsite clinician confirmation when data became available, and did not fabricate prognosis, staging, or a chemotherapy plan.",
